File Index

/settings.json
Purpose: This file configures bot permissions and registers the qdigest-guard PreToolUse hook that forces long-output shell commands through qdigest.

/hooks/qdigest-guard.js
Purpose: PreToolUse hook script that denies long-output-prone Bash/PowerShell commands unless wrapped in Shattered-AI's qdigest.sh (local qwen digestion).

/hooks/read-pack-guard.js
Purpose: PreToolUse hook script that denies full Reads of files over 40 KB, steering toward Grep+ranged Read, qwen summarize/ask, or cli.js pack (context packs).

/skills/qdigest/SKILL.md
Purpose: Claude Code skill documenting the qdigest/qwen delegation flow — command wrapping, cli.js pack/summarize usage, and host-to-container path mapping.

/settings.local.json
Purpose: This file defines local development permissions and allowed commands for the ShatteredArchive project.
